WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.380
To download the latest version of blender , search Blender in your browser

00:00:06.337 --> 00:00:25.857
In the results, click on the first link, www.blender.org.  We can see the download button there.   You can click it to download the file.

00:00:26.865 --> 00:00:40.369
I am using Windows OS, You can select the file according to your choice. Apart from windows there are files for mac and linux.

00:00:42.232 --> 00:00:47.192
I have selected windows installer , and the files will start to download automatically when clicked.

00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:59.704
I am fast forwarding the downloading process.

00:01:05.009 --> 00:01:15.859
Now the file has been downloaded

00:01:15.859 --> 00:01:24.366
You can double click and run the file.

00:01:27.221 --> 00:02:00.106
Now a blender window will pop-up, you can tick the agreement and click next, specifying the install location.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.880
When the installation is complete you can click the Finish button.

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:15.536
Then you can search blender in your search bar and open the program.

00:02:25.308 --> 00:02:34.814
You can see this Interface when the program is open. These are the basic interface settings that you can tweak.

00:02:34.983 --> 00:02:42.477
For example you can change the theme to deep grey or white.

00:02:44.342 --> 00:02:46.612
Then you can press continue and choose general layout.

00:02:48.389 --> 00:02:55.363
This is the opening layout for blender, you can see a default cube geometry.

00:02:55.363 --> 00:02:57.363
And this is the installation procedure.

00:02:57.363 --> 00:03:06.665
For those who want to approach blender professionally, I am planning for a set of tutorials in this channel

00:03:06.928 --> 00:03:12.878
Interested can subscribe my channel, you can support me by liking my content if its good ,

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:18.592
and comment your opinion below which can guide me to prepare my next contents.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:22.520
see you next

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:23.638
time